<title>FINLAND: NESTE TO CUT STAFF AT REFINERY -PAPER.</title>
<headline>NESTE TO CUT STAFF AT REFINERY -PAPER.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish oil and energy group Neste Oy would dismiss about 120 employees at its oil refinery in the south-western town of Naantali to boost profitability, daily newspaper Helsingin Sanomat reported on Friday.</p>
<p>The refinery has 463 employees, the paper said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
